# Pairs with EveryLinkLands. A link abandoned after a cascade leaves its split unlinked.
MODULE: CascadeLinkAbandoned
TARGET: EveryLinkLands
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the cascade finishes without the link ever being reported
PERTURBS: CascadeSeeded

--- FIND
    /\ ch[o] = "cascade"
    /\ ch' = [ch EXCEPT ![o] = "return"]
--- REPLACE
    /\ ch[o] = "cascade"
    \* MUTATION: the link is abandoned
    /\ ch' = [ch EXCEPT ![o] = "done"]
--- END
